<title>USA: Coca-Cola Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.31		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net		 762,000		  648,000</p>
<p> Oper revs	 4,443,000		4,333,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  2,485,000		2,507,000</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.40		    $1.18</p>
<p> Net		 3,492,000		2,986,000</p>
<p> Oper revs	 18,546,000	     18,018,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  2,494,000		2,525,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income per share and average shares outstanding have been adjuested to reflect a May 1 two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
